title: "WRF-Agent (public preview)"
authors:
  - name: "WRF-Agent Team"
version: "0.1.0-preview"
date-released: "2026-10-25"
description: >-
  Configuration fidelity tooling for WRF experiment batches: an audit of the start-up consistency checks of WRF,
  rule checks on an experiment specification, and deterministic namelist generation with per-parameter provenance.
  Testing-stage subset of a larger code base.
keywords:
  - WRF
  - configuration
  - reproducibility
  - scientific workflows
